Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,get help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning bright. For what's ahead you\Nsee is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way, the best that we\Nknow. With tears and doubts and tone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll go where we all wanna go The\Npage within brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this, you traitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's what I believe is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Finger pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you write down your wish yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to light up the sky boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's fly it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's time to send\Nyour wish to the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.46,0:03:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right now, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.94,0:03:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's bending the earth of his attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that part of his Robert Powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.22,0:04:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't show mercy. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.50,0:04:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,With the bull heading!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.34,0:04:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, you're so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one who can\Npredict people's attacks, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even copy your technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.22,0:04:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:04:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Jimmy, he ate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I said let me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:06:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.44,0:06:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Form of Bounceman!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That scaly bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's beating the crap out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta turn this around!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming back for more, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be running\Nout of steam after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Once 4th gear wears off, I'm done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of time to finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fourth gear, don't fail me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never thought those rubber powers of\Nyours would give me so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're about done, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I am never done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy the finale, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'm not here to have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen what you've done to Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't even find water to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Or enough food to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as long as you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.52,0:07:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they lost the battle to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You should thank me for\Nletting them keep their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Side with who you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But the people of Wano are losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Worse yet, they've grown\Naccustomed to being losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The weak bow down, and the honorable die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.14,0:08:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Over and over, I've watched them make\Npathetic excuses for their failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how\Nstrong the samurai are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they strong or are they acting strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,true strength doesn't require praise
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it speaks for itself are you the real
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.74,0:08:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing or not, it's time to find out. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Overcome, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.86,0:09:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Done. Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make sure he's down for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Force gear's gonna run\Nout on me any second now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder Meadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Barbara!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.42,0:10:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,One shot. It's time to finish up\Nthe story. I'm betting everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:11:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,i've got on this all right brash\Nshow me win or lose this is the end
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you're gonna feel this one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dun-dun-dun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Panaballo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.52,0:11:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,CP-Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear it. Luffy's voice is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle on the rooftop\Nhas come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner, Kaido, King of the Beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.58,0:14:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:15:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.80,0:15:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceiling's gonna collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to evacuate now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot flee when thousands of our\Ncomrades are still in the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we have to make it home together, but\Nwe're too high up to reach the seawater.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there nothing we can\Ndo to stop this fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, run to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no honor in burning to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Last breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is your leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Odin's son to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Momonosuke\Nto announce his surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.12,0:16:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's voice went\Nsilent, so it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems he was no match for an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to be lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy would never.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You would never.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.18,0:17:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If any of you still have the\Ncourage to defy me, then step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't had my fill of\Nviolence for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:17:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let him keep lying
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.88,0:18:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does that snake think he's fooling
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.20,0:18:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a liar, and I won't\Nlet him get away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You think Luffy's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we'll just believe\Nyour stupid lies and give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.78,0:18:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When Luffy says he'll win,\Nhe'll do it no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He will never lose, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.98,0:18:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and he will not die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now that's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.32,0:18:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,At least one of you\Nhas some guts. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you don't seem to understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,allow me to teach you\Nthe meaning of defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Last prayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,For a gushing of the land\Nof the flower capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will take control\Nof the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Morochi has been too lenient on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you true suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This country will be my\Nweapons factory and all men,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,women, and children will be my slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're too exhausted\Nto work, roll over and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time we lose a slave,\Nwe'll just replace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.16,0:20:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My wrath is the price\Nyou pay for your defiance
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what happens\Nwhen you lose a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life belongs to the victor Your hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and dreams are mine to\Ntrample However I please
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Mamorosuke here. I'll continue\Nto slaughter until that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your country is finished Your children and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,your children's children\Nwill sink into despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the cost of your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid-in-law barely alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's butcher them while they're down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you took out Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You are never gonna meet Commander Kido!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You took your own dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:20:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Little shits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.54,0:21:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the captains!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We better help out\Nthose samurai! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's fire everywhere! We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there a way out? Keep looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You still got some fight\Nleft in you, Trafalgar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.56,0:21:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm not gonna sit\Nhere and wait to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.74,0:22:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gone mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.24,0:22:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't possibly win now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we hope to succeed\Nwhen even Luffy failed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.02,0:22:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to live until we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll put our lives on the\Nline until we breathe our last.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.56,0:22:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as Samurai should.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't do it, then who else will?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.30,0:22:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our allies are wounded right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.32,0:22:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But so is Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.76,0:22:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.88,0:22:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, this is absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.62,0:22:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido is an emperor of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We underestimated his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.26,0:22:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is no longer within our reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.38,0:22:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If we continue to resist, it\Nwill only result in more deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We did our best, but it\Nsimply wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is difficult to\Nhear, but Luffy has lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.94,0:22:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.24,0:22:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I will never allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.00,0:22:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't live as a slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.96,0:22:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You think there's value in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Living your life in chains waiting to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.18,0:22:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know that\Nsurrendering will save anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.54,0:23:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.86,0:23:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop you myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The daimyo who stood up to\NOrochi died hungry for revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but they never gave up on this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.10,0:23:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We've inherited its future,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and we carry the weight of all the\Ndreams that they couldn't fulfill!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.68,0:23:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and even if you and I die here tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.54,0:23:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,at least we'll die together!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.46,0:24:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.62,0:24:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, I can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.14,0:24:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.86,0:24:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Zonesia, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.20,0:24:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear the drums of liberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.96,0:24:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time in\N800 years, he is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.12,0:24:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.28,0:25:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.74,0:25:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Joy Boy has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.54,0:25:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
